# Demiurge-Cloud Git LFS Configuration
#
# LFS tracking is currently DISABLED. The 26 media assets previously tracked
# here (badge PNG/MP4 files under apps/hub/public/assets/badges/) exist in this
# import only as LFS pointer stubs of 128-132 bytes; their binary objects were
# not present in the source archive, and GitHub rejects pointers whose objects
# are missing.
#
# To restore: fetch the real binaries from the original LFS store, drop them in
# place, uncomment the rules below, then `git add --renormalize .`.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What GitHub reports this repository is made of
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Linguist weighs a repository by BYTES, and `apps/` alone is about 10.5 MB of
# roughly 14.4 MB tracked. Left alone, GitHub's language bar says Demiurge is a
# TypeScript project. It is not: the active code is a Rust Substrate L1 in
# `chain/`, a Rust identity service in `services/qor-auth/`, and a Rust and
# React desktop application in `tools/qor-launcher/`, together about 2.2 MB.
#
# The trees below are frozen (D-011, amended by ADR-011) or dead, and
# `docs/DIRECTION.md` section 8 lists them as such: not maintained, not a
# reference, and not extended. Excluding them from the language statistics makes
# the front page describe the project someone would actually be contributing to.
#
# `linguist-detectable=false` is deliberate, and is narrower than it looks: it
# changes the language bar and NOTHING else. The files stay tracked, stay
# searchable, stay in diffs and stay reviewable. Nothing is hidden.
#
# If any of these trees is brought back into scope, delete its line here in the
# same change that does so.

# Frozen (D-011, amended by ADR-011)
apps/**       linguist-detectable=false
cli/**        linguist-detectable=false
sdk/**        linguist-detectable=false
packages/**   linguist-detectable=false
client/**     linguist-detectable=false

# Dead: built by no workspace (docs/DIRECTION.md section 8)
aeons/**      linguist-detectable=false
archons/**    linguist-detectable=false
syzygies/**   linguist-detectable=false

# Unverified operational files that predate the realignment. They are kept so
# they can be rewritten or deleted deliberately, not because they work; several
# reference directories that no longer exist. Do not deploy from them.
testnet/**    linguist-detectable=false
docker/**     linguist-detectable=false
config/**     linguist-detectable=false

